<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech ZPS Zlin issues 5-yr bond - PSE.</title>
<headline>Czech ZPS Zlin issues 5-yr bond - PSE.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech machinery maker ZPS Zlin a.s. on Tuesday issued a one billion crown tranche of five-year bonds with a fixed annual coupon of 12.0 percent, the Prague Stock Exchange (PSE) said.</p>
<p>The PSE added the bonds were issued at par with their 100,000 crown nominal value.</p>
</text>
